{"text":"Hello, Sally. What's this? It's a book. What's that? It's a box. Wow! What's that? It's a pen. Wow! It's a pencil. What is it? It's a ruler. Wow! What is it? It's a pencil case. What is in it? Pencils and a ruler. Wow! That's a lot of school things. Yes, I love school.","segments":[{"text":"Hello, Sally.","start":3.38,"duration":1.41},{"text":"What's this?","start":4.79,"duration":14.37},{"text":"It's a book.","start":19.16,"duration":7.83},{"text":"What's that?","start":26.99,"duration":2.08},{"text":"It's a box.","start":29.07,"duration":10.81},{"text":"Wow!","start":39.89,"duration":0.66},{"text":"What's that?","start":40.55,"duration":1.33},{"text":"It's a pen.","start":41.88,"duration":12.69},{"text":"Wow!","start":54.57,"duration":0.69},{"text":"It's a pencil.","start":55.26,"duration":3.12},{"text":"What is it?","start":58.38,"duration":4.04},{"text":"It's a ruler.","start":62.42,"duration":30.5},{"text":"Wow!","start":92.93,"duration":0.84},{"text":"What is it?","start":93.77,"duration":2.45},{"text":"It's a pencil case.","start":96.22,"duration":4.04},{"text":"What is in it?","start":100.26,"duration":4.54},{"text":"Pencils and a ruler.","start":104.8,"duration":7.63},{"text":"Wow!","start":112.43,"duration":0.83},{"text":"That's a lot of school things.","start":113.27,"duration":5.62},{"text":"Yes, I love school.","start":118.89,"duration":4.81}],"fetchedAt":"2026-06-24T06:36:09Z","captionType":"manual","videoId":"0QrcDQSxfCY"}